OL,3,GNEWSAWest Wales to Bristol train
OL,4,Aservice approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new cross-border rail service has
OL,7,Fbeen given the go ahead by a travel
OL,8,Fregulator.
OL,10,FTransport for Wales (TfW) will be
OL,11,Frunning a two-hourly service from west
OL,12,FWales to Bristol Temple Meads following
OL,13,Fapproval by the Office of Rail and Road
OL,14,F(ORR).
OL,16,FTfW, which is owned by the Welsh
OL,17,Fgovernment, said it hoped to "connect
OL,18,Fcommunities" beyond the capital,
OL,19,Fproviding new opportunities for work
OL,20,Fand leisure.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
