OL,3,GNEWSAWest Wales to Bristol train
OL,4,Aservice approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring its application phase, Great
OL,7,FWestern Railway (GWR), which already
OL,8,Fruns Cardiff to Bristol trains, said a
OL,9,Fnew line could have a "significant
OL,10,Feffect" on its revenue. But now the
OL,11,Foperator says it is looking forward to
OL,12,Fworking with TfW to ensure services are
OL,13,Fprovided in a coordinated way.
